		(uuid "aa38c785-8844-4966-ab0c-d9e808b49fed")
	)
  (text "SW1 = start/stop button under the membrane: VDD -> SW1 -> P0.04, NO resistor\nfirmware MUST turn on the pin's pulldown (11 to 16k @ PS p371) + SENSE HIGH (README F6)\n= the signal that wakes the MCU from system OFF @ PS p87 = how the device turns ON\nD2 = RGB LED for ID / state / charge, on SYS, data from P0.13 at 800kbps @ LED DS p1\nC42 100n = its supply cap @ LED DS p6. supply 3.3 to 5.3V @ LED DS p3 = out of spec below a 3.3V cell\ndata HIGH must reach 0.55 x SYS @ LED DS p3, MCU gives VDD - 0.4V min @ PS p370\n-> charger SYS setting NEVER above 4.5V, NEVER pass through (README F1)\nR22 10k pulldown: P0.13 floats after every MCU reset @ PS p370 so it holds DI LOW = idle @ LED DS p5\ncell max 300mA @ cell spec p3. card 100mA @ SD spec p50 + LED 36mA @ LED DS p4 + MCU 16.2mA @ PS p81 = 152mA (calc)\n-> NO firmware limit needed. pack protection trip level = TBD\nJ3 = Tag-Connect TC2030 pads, nothing fitted: 1 VDD, 2 SWDIO, 3 nRESET, 4 SWDCLK, 5 GND, 6 SWO\ndebug port NOT locked on this QIAA-R, lock = UICR APPROTECT @ PS p68\nTP1-3, TP5 = 0.6mm pads: BAT, SYS, VDD, GND (TP4 = 32k clock, MCU sheet)"
    (at 20.32 118.11 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "c5d9fbe7-6833-471e-8982-f3627351ccf7")
  )
